  "text": "Profit is not finished just because the trade closed green.\n\nA win still has to be protected. If every dollar stays exposed by default, one rough move can quietly pull the progress back into the market.\n\nSometimes the quiet move is stepping aside first. Preserve the gain, let the emotion settle, then redeploy only when the next setup actually deserves the capital.\n\nStablecoins are not a promise and not risk free. They are simply one tool traders may use to pause, think clearly, and avoid forcing the next trade.\n\nEducational content only. Not financial advice.\n\n#TheBetterTraders #CryptoTrading #TradingEducation #TradingPlan",
